  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Pact South Sudan Peace and Security Programme</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">Pact Sydsudan Freds- och s&#xe4;kerhetsfr&#xe4;mjande</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">Pact South Sudan ska i samarbete med lokala parters, UNDP, WB, och    andra parterer st&#xe4;rka lokal kapacitet hantera konflikter p&#xe5; ett       fredligt s&#xe4;tt; bidra till ett starkare civilsamh&#xe4;lle; samt st&#xe4;rka     samh&#xe4;llsengagemang p&#xe5; lokal niv&#xe5; f&#xf6;r offentliga utvecklingsprojekt    f&#xf6;r &#xf6;kad lokaldemokrati i Sydsudan.</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Pact South Sudan will together with local partners, UNDP, WB and      other stakeholders strengthen local capacity to manage conflicts      peacefully;contribute to a strengthened civil society; and support    local involvement and participation in development initiatives for    enhanced local democracy.</narrative>
  </description>
